   "parts": [
    {
     "text": "You're building someone you might hate.",
     "mode": "story",
     "pause": 0.7,
     "gains": [
      1.15
     ]
    },
    {
     "text": "Not with big moments. With small choices.",
     "mode": "normal",
     "pause": 0.8
    },
    {
     "text": "Hitting snooze. Skipping the workout. Scrolling instead of reading.",
     "mode": "story",
     "pause": 0.8
    },
    {
     "text": "Each one is a brick.",
     "mode": "quote",
     "pause": 0.8
    },
    {
     "text": "And you don't notice the wall going up.",
     "mode": "normal",
     "pause": 0.9
    },
    {
     "text": "Until one day you look in the mirror, and you meet the person you built.",
     "mode": "quote",
     "pause": 1.1
    },
    {
     "text": "Here's the part that changes everything:",
     "mode": "normal",
     "pause": 0.6
    },
    {
     "text": "you were never choosing whether to build.",
     "mode": "quote",
     "pause": 0.5
    },
    {
     "text": "Only who.",
     "mode": "quote",
     "pause": 1.1,
     "gains": [
      1.15
     ]
    },
    {
     "text": "Every hour you show up is a gold brick. Every excuse is a grey one.",
     "mode": "story",
     "pause": 0.9
    },
    {
     "text": "So look at today, and ask yourself:",
     "mode": "normal",
     "pause": 0.5
    },
    {
     "text": "what am I building?",
     "mode": "quote",
     "pause": 1.0,
     "gains": [
      1.1
     ]
    },
    {
     "text": "Build someone you'd be proud to meet.",
     "mode": "quote",
